/*******************************************************************************
* Define      : KI_COMMS_TASK_ID
* Group       : GKI, Config
* Description : This configures what task is used for communicating between
*                   the target (GKI) and a host PC. This task will be the route
*                   through which logging signals will be sent to the host PC and
