 *  File Description :
 *      GKI Semaphore types
 *
 *      Semaphores are NOT supported within the GKI. This file is supplied
 *      to allow definition of semaphore bits that will be seen anywhere
 *      the Kernel is used. If semaphores are used they should be restricted
 *      to communication with interrupts i.e. non-portable code.
 **************************************************************************/




